{"title":"생각해볼게","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bNdxqS/dJMb9NInsRc/FqbE4MkdxFBrtkTnonArF1&filename=th3","synopsis":"책에 파묻혀 지내는 열다섯 살 고영희.\n인간관계는 재난과 같다고 생각한다. \n‘가족’, ‘연인’이라는 말에는 그저 몸서리가 쳐질 뿐. \n\n생각도 걱정도 많은 고영희 앞에 \n\"좋아한다.\"며 마음을 고백하는 같은 반 소녀 김강아의 출현! \n게다가 우연의 장난으로 한 집에 살기까지 해야 한다니... \n요지경의 한복판에 떨어지고 말았다. \n\n엄마, 아빠, 강아, 아저씨, 학교 아이들, 이 땅의 모든 사람들.\n다들 생각이란 걸 하고 살기는 하는지 원망스럽다.\n사춘기에 찾아온 인생 최대 위기.\n죽상에 울상인 채 책을 덮고 현실 세상으로 달려나간다.\n\n긴 생각의 끝에는 어떤 답을 찾게 될까.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":227,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":230,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":252,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":178,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":167,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":205,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":197,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":202,"change":{"type":"up","amount":82}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":189,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":222,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":260,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":259,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":261,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":169,"change":{"type":"up","amount":92}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":193,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":226,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09